From 975be671a0dc81a8cad6b6984ae8165861510d15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 02:53:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] Sharing between the professionals in the app

"Sharing" on the follow-up card lists each professional with a switch per
kind of data the user can share with them, with the texts of the web app;
their own area is not offered (a physiotherapist already sees the pain
records). Turning a switch on creates the grant, for which the server
records the consent; turning it off revokes the grant and the consent,
both kept as evidence. A failed change says so and leaves the switch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
